{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00526","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 德和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 德和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕惕司龙契，晨兢当凤扆。\n崇儒习旧规，偃伯循先旨。\n绝壤飞冠盖，遐区丽山水。\n幸承三圣余，忻属千年始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}